      "statement": "Assuming exactness in each smaller ambient rank, a horizontal a-cycle with the auxiliary unimodular list of length b≥1 fixed bounds in that row under 2a+b+s+1≤n. When b=1, a=p and 2p+s+1≤n, it bounds in the full split complex.",
      "hypotheses": "Same commutative ring and stable range as SCM-01. The induction hypothesis is exactness for all n′<n at every length p′ with 2p′+s+1≤n′.",
