  "outstanding": [
    "The ordinary unimodular-list exactness theorem is identified through its coordinate-subspace and affine-link proof. The subsidiary stable row reductions and the individual link-retraction chain operators remain cited providers. The main conclusion is augmented integral chain exactness in a sufficient range."
